    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d11">

                <pb facs="0103" n="23" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg23"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Lord to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Buenos Ayres</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-09-01"><hi rendition="#italic">September 1,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 200.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my No. 191, of June 3 last, I
                    have the honor to inform you that on Sunday, August 24, an official Te Deum was
                    celebrated in the cathedial of this city in commemoration of the signing by
                    Chile and by the Argentine Republic of the peace agreements therein referred to.
                    The Argentine war ship <hi rendition="#italic">San Martin</hi> left yesterday
                    the port of Bahia Blanca en route for Chile with the purpose of effecting the
                    exchange of ratifications.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wm. P. Lord</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
